# Haazda Vigilante (a 4/4): "Whenever this creature enters or attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control with power 2 or less." Entering, the only
# creature it can aim at is Bot1's Ornithopter (power 0): the Vigilante itself is 4/4 and Bot2's Ornithopter, which arrives later, is not Bot1's. The Ornithopter
# becomes 1/3. Attacking on turn 3 it is power 1 (legal) and becomes 2/4; attacking on turn 5 it is power 2, still "2 or less", and becomes 3/5; attacking on turn 7 it
# is power 3, no creature is a legal target and nothing happens. The Vigilante and Bot2's Ornithopter never get a counter.

